cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its models, please cite the paper below and the Saliency4ASD dataset."
title: "ASD Screening Android App"
abstract: >-
  On-device screening for autism spectrum disorder from a child's gaze on single pictures.
  A two-stream teacher (frozen ViT-B/16 plus a temporal gaze encoder) is distilled into a
  1.6M-parameter MobileNetV3 student that runs as an ONNX ensemble inside an Android app.
